acity questions deeper; reserve F061 for the supplemental front-storage batch. VISUAL / HANDOFF \u2014 Keep the entire main batch on the literal folded seatbacks im_pdf_adb415f161dfc9567dde, leave recline for deeper because it is a different mechanism without a literal operating picture, and hand off the airbags around the occupants with an empty checkin.", "outcome": "Arrange passenger space and luggage space", "topic": "space-and-practicality", "fact_ids": ["F001", "F020", "F021", "F022", "F023", "F024", "F059", "F060", "F061", "F063"], "usp_ids": ["space-for-changing-plans"], "visual_refs": ["im_pdf_adb415f161dfc9567dde", "im_pdf_74c2156461739f493698", "im_pdf_086219c79f5c77a4f468", "im_pdf_31ed8989f6cc45b71b53", "im_pdf_06658fba292467f801c7"], "priority_topic": true, "stop_id": "space-and-practicality", "fundamental": true, "word_budget": 32}, {"id": "airbags-and-help", "title": "Airbags and help with the car ahead", "role": "proof", "goal": "MOMENT \u2014 B1 looks at the airbags around the seats, while B2 opens with watching the vehicle ahead on an ordinary drive. SPOKEN / DEEPER \u2014 Allocate B1 31 words to F025 for six driver, passenger, side and curtain airbags even on E, explaining that the equipment is included without a higher-trim purchase, and B2 31 words to F031/F032/F034 for forward-collision warning/assistance on King, King Knight and Lounge Edition with attentive-driver responsibility; hold F026\u2013F030/F033/F035/F036/F062 deeper under exact standard, camera-from-SX-Premium and selected-automatic scopes. VISUAL / HANDOFF \u2014 Use only the airbag illustration im_pdf_a54e8e56f4b50c2f5596 for B1 and only the forward-detection illustration im_pdf_87d94ba1ddd0b388c716 for B2, hand off forward-collision assistance and then the front temperature controls respectively, and keep checkins empty across 62 words without a crash-score or guaranteed-intervention claim.", "outcome": "Distinguish standard equipment and driving assistance", "topic": "safety", 