F001 [spec·stated] Body and driveline: five-door, five-seat compact SUV (conditions: All variants; manufacturer compilation dated 19 September 2026) (source: src_0ac142; locator: PDF page 3; quote: "The Hyundai CRETA is a five-door, five-seat compact SUV built by Hyundai Motor India and sold with front-wheel\ndrive across the whole range.")
